description: Digital Evolution project conventions
globs:
  - "apps/**/*.ts"
  - "apps/**/*.tsx"
  - "packages/**/*.ts"
  - "tools/**/*.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow `AGENTS.md`. Key conventions for this codebase:

- Dependency direction: `apps/explorer` -> `sim-runtime` -> `sim-core`; `sim-analysis` is read-only and never changes biology.
- `sim-core` must not use React, DOM APIs, workers, storage, filesystem APIs, `requestAnimationFrame`, or wall-clock time.
- Same engine version + config + seed + command sequence must stay deterministic.
- Never edit `legacy/prototype/`. Verify with `pnpm verify` before finishing.
